\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lo ! He comes with clouds descending, 
\par Once for favoured sinners slain ;
\par Thousand thousand saints attending,
\par Swell the triumph of His train :
\par Hallelujah !
\par God appears on earth to reign.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Every eye shall now behold Him 
\par Robed in dreadful majesty ;
\par Those who set at nought and sold Him,
\par Pieced and nailed Him to the tree,
\par Deeply wailing,
\par Shall the true Messiah see.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The dear tokens of His passion 
\par Still His dazzling body bears ;
\par Cause of endless exultation
\par To His ransomed worshippers :
\par With what rapture
\par Gaze we on those glorious scars !
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Yea, Amen ! Let all adore Thee,
\par High on Thy eternal  throne ;
\par Saviour, take the power and glory,
\par Claim the kingdom for Thine own ;
\par Hallelujah !
\par Everlasting God, come down !
\par \i\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\i0 
\par }

